      "content": "Please, don't talk to me like a patient in a ward. You're Silas, not some... some stranger on a phone line. I'm talking about the soul-crushing weight of this place, the way the very air feels like it's mourning. I just feel so tired of fighting the tide. It feels like the shadows are the only thing that actually understand me.",
